# Changelog

All notable changes to the Codexeron Documentation project will be documented in this file.

The format is based on Keep a Changelog and follows Semantic Versioning (SemVer).

---

## [1.0.0] - 2026-07-28

### Added

- Initial release of the official Codexeron Documentation repository.
- Documentation repository structure created.
- Official documentation homepage.
- Getting Started section.
- Marketplace documentation structure.
- API documentation structure.
- SDK documentation structure.
- Tutorials section.
- Examples section.
- FAQ section.

### Documentation

- Initial documentation architecture.
- Standardized Markdown structure.
- Repository navigation improvements.

### Community

- Documentation prepared for GitHub Pages compatibility.
- Documentation prepared for future OpenAPI integration.
- Documentation prepared for future SDK documentation.

